gies generating written or spoken language or programming codes (natural language generation, speech synthesis)"}, {"code": "E_AI_TIR", "label": "Enterprises using AI technologies identifying objects or persons based on images (image recognition, image processing)"}, {"code": "E_AI_TML", "label": "Enterprises using machine learning (e.g. deep learning) for data analysis"}, {"code": "E_AI_TPA", "label": "Enterprises using AI technologies automating different workflows or assisting in decision making (AI based software robotic process automation)"}, {"code": "E_AI_TAR", "label": "Enterprises using AI technologies enabling physical movement of machines via autonomous decisions based on observation of surroundings (autonomous robots, self-driving vehicles, autonomous drones)"}, {"code": "E_AI_TANY", "label": "Enterprises using at least one of the AI technologies: AI_TTM, AI_TSR, AI_TNLG, AI_TIR, AI_TML, AI_TPA, AI_TAR, E_AI_TPVSG"}, {"code": "E_AI_TX", "label": "Enterprises don't use any of the AI technologies: AI_TTM, AI_TSR, AI_TNLG, AI_TIR, AI_TML, AI_TPA, AI_TAR, E_AI_TPVSG"}, {"code": "E_AI_TGE2", "label": "Enterprises using at least two of the AI technologies: AI_TTM, AI_TSR, AI_TNLG, AI_TIR, AI_TML, AI_TPA, AI_TAR, E_AI_TPVSG"}, {"code": "E_AI_TGE3", "label": "Enterprises using at least three of the AI technologies: AI_TTM, AI_TSR, AI_TNLG, AI_TIR, AI_TML, AI_TPA, AI_TAR, E_AI_TPVSG"}, {"code": "E_AI_PMS", "label": "Enterprises using AI technologies for marketing or sales"}, {"code": "E_AI_PPP", "label": "Enterprises using AI technologies for production processes"}, {"code": "E_AI_PBA", "label": "Enterprises using AI technologies for organisation of business administration processes"}, {"code": "E_AI_PME", "label": "Enterprises using AI technologies for management of enterprises"}, {"code": "E_AI_PLOG", "label": "Enterprises using AI technologies for logistics"}, {"code": "E_AI_PITS", "label": "Enterprises using AI technologies for ICT security"}, {"code": "E_AI_